<title>CANADA: Ego raises C$1.4 million.</title>
<headline>Ego raises C$1.4 million.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ego Resources Ltd said on Tuesday that it has agreed to the private sale of 2.8 million units to raise a total of C$1.4 million.</p>
<p>Each unit is comprised of one common share and one half of a common share purchase warrant, Ego said in a statement.</p>
<p>The warrants are exercisable at a price of C$1 per share and expire on January 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Ego said it plans to use the proceeds for the purchase, installation and start-up of a second feedstream at its Cobatec plant in Northern Ontario, and for general working capital purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
